From: Niagara SMP investigation <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] target/sparc: report the current Niagara strand ID

The ASI_CMT_STRAND_ID emulation returned physical strand zero for every
vCPU.  The sun4v hypervisor uses this value to select per-strand state, so
secondary CPUs aliased strand zero and could not enter their own work loop.

Use the QEMU CPU index as the emulated physical strand ID.
---
 target/sparc/ldst_helper.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/target/sparc/ldst_helper.c b/target/sparc/ldst_helper.c
index f48aa1b..0eafb17 100644
--- a/target/sparc/ldst_helper.c
+++ b/target/sparc/ldst_helper.c
@@ -1709,7 +1709,7 @@ uint64_t helper_ld_asi(CPUSPARCState *env, target_ulong addr,
 
 	    break;
 	case 0x00000010ULL:	/* ASI_CMT_STRAND_ID */
-	    ret = 7ULL << 32 | 0x3fULL << 16 | 0ULL;
+	    ret = 7ULL << 32 | 0x3fULL << 16 | (cs->cpu_index & 0x3f);
 	    break;
 	}
 	break;
